  "details": "Before, the default Vive binding didn't have analog locomotion/rotation speed : you used to click everywhere on the trackpad and you used to move/rotate at full speed. Only the advanced binding has analog speed.\n\n Now, both the default binding and advanced bindings have analog speed.",
